  "content": "<h4>从FTB Chunks 1902.4.0版本开始，如果您希望将KubeJS、FTB Ranks/Luckperms、Waystones和Game Stages与FTB Chunks集成，则需要使用<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-xmod-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB XMod Compat</a>。</h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这是一个允许您认领区块以保护您方块的模组。它还包含小地图和大地图功能！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在地图任意位置右键点击可创建路径点。</p><p>右键点击路径点和死亡点可编辑或删除它们。</p><p>点击\"已认领区块\"按钮，然后在地图上左键或右键点击以选择属于您的区块。在已认领的区块上按住Shift键左键或右键点击可切换强制加载。</p><p>通过\"盟友\"按钮将其他玩家添加为盟友，允许他们与您的区块互动。（此功能近期已更新，后续会推出更新版本）</p><p>如果对方也将您添加为盟友，你们可以共享地图数据。</p><p>&nbsp;\n<img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/K5sXkH.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/tZp_4N.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/bNT8Q9.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/b1/5W2MKd.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><h2>保持最新</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
